        <mxCell id="gldNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Ready to use&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- One wide daily row per participant&lt;br&gt;- Daily partition overwritten per run&lt;br&gt;- Weekly derived only from daily&lt;br&gt;- Study weeks run Thursday to Wednesday&lt;br&gt;- dim_participant joins to both" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="gld">
